<h4 class="about-text"><span class="accent"><strong>Seekers</strong></span></h4>

<p class="about-text">
Individuals who show interest in the order and are starting on the lions journey,
but not yet fully pledged members of the Order.
</p>


<h4 class="about-text"><span class="accent"><strong>Akousmatikoi</strong></span></h4>

<p class="about-text">
Those who have began their journey and started to listen,
just like the great Pythagoras once taught them.
</p>


<h4 class="about-text"><span class="accent"><strong>Heralds</strong></span></h4>

<p class="about-text">
Full members of the order. They have given their lives to study and now live in duty of sharing and contributing humanity.
</p>


<h4 class="about-text"><span class="accent"><strong>Keepers of the Bell</strong></span></h4>

<p class="about-text">
Senior members entrusted with safeguarding the traditions and teachings of the Order and protecting the integrity of knowledge and the institution.
</p>


<br>
<p class="about-text">
The order is guided by its founder and leader.<br>
There cannot be another Lion, as he is the reincarnation of the great Sage.<br>
In the founder’s absence the Supreme Herald and the Keepers of the Bell serve as
the guiding authority of the Order.<br>
<span class="accent"> In the year 34500 since Zep Tepi.</span>
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

